---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import rayProfilePic from "../assets/Ray/13-raybigbass.png";
import lakeIsabella from "../assets/Ray/Lake-Isabella.jpg";
import lakeIsabellaTournament from "../assets/Ray/Lake-Isabella-Tournament.jpg";
import mbaaSilverwood from "../assets/Ray/MBAA-Tourney-Silverwood.jpg";

const galleryImages = [
  {
    src: lakeIsabella,
    alt: "Ray Caldwell catching a bass fish at Lake Isabella",
    title: "Ray Caldwell at Lake Isabella",
  },
  {
    src: lakeIsabellaTournament,
    alt: "Fishing team posing with awards at Lake Isabella tournament",
    title: "Fishing Team posing with Awards",
  },
  {
    src: mbaaSilverwood,
    alt: "Bass fish caught at Silverwood MBAA tournament",
    title: "Bass Caught at Silverwood MBAA Tournament",
  },
];
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,rgba(14,116,144,0.14),transparent_48%),radial-gradient(circle_at_bottom_right,rgba(15,23,42,0.12),transparent_42%)]"
  >
  </div>

  <div
    class="relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col gap-8 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14 lg:gap-12 lg:px-8 lg:py-16"
  >
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-cyan-800/90 underline decoration-cyan-500/40 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-cyan-900 hover:decoration-cyan-700/60"
      aria-label="Back to home page"
    >
      <span aria-hidden="true">&larr;</span>
      Back to Home
    </a>

    <header
      class="grid gap-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/60 bg-white/70 p-5 shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/5 backdrop-blur sm:p-7 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_300px] md:p-8"
    >
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <p
          class="inline-flex w-fit rounded-full bg-cyan-100 px-3 py-1 text-[0.68rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan-800 uppercase"
        >
          About Ray Caldwell
        </p>
        <h1
          class="text-3xl leading-tight font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-[2.6rem]"
        >
          Meet the Owner
        </h1>
        <p
          class="max-w-2xl text-[1.02rem] leading-7 text-slate-700 sm:text-[1.08rem] sm:leading-8"
        >
          My name is Ray Caldwell, owner of True Image Enterprise. I am from
          Longview, Texas, and I grew up fishing many lakes with my dad, D.C.
          Caldwell.
        </p>
        <p
          class="max-w-2xl text-[1.02rem] leading-7 text-slate-700 sm:text-[1.08rem] sm:leading-8"
        >
          Through military tournaments, years of western competition, and
          mentorship from top anglers, I built a style focused on technique,
          discipline, and consistency.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/10"
      >
        <Image
          src={rayProfilePic}
          alt="Ray Caldwell holding a bass fish"
          title="Ray Caldwell"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          widths={[320, 480, 640]}
          sizes="(min-width: 768px) 280px, 100vw"
          loading="eager"
          format="webp"
        />
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {
        galleryImages.map((image) => (
          <figure class="group overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-md shadow-slate-900/5">
            <Image
              src={image.src}
              alt={image.alt}
              title={image.title}
              class="h-56 w-full object-cover transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.03] sm:h-60"
              widths={[480, 720, 960]}
              sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 33vw, (min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw"
              loading="eager"
              format="webp"
            />
            <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-sm leading-6 font-medium tracking-wide text-slate-700">
              {image.title}
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <article
      class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl space-y-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/80 p-6 text-[1rem] leading-7 text-slate-700 shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/5 backdrop-blur sm:p-8 sm:text-[1.05rem] sm:leading-8 lg:p-10"
    >
      <p>
        During my naval career, I fished as a non-boater in MBAA (Military Bass
        Anglers Association) draw tournaments. Later, as a defense contract
        worker, I moved west to Ridgecrest, California, and quickly learned it
        was a different fishology.
      </p>

      <p>
        A co-worker at the Naval Weapons Center, Jeff Stuart, invited me into
        MBAA tournaments. My first event was in Yuma, Arizona, on the Colorado
        River. I did not weigh a fish that day, but that moment shaped my
        mindset and growth as an angler.
      </p>

      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-7">
        <section class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-5 sm:p-6">
          <h2
            class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl"
          >
            As a Director
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3.5">
            I received three Director Achievement Awards, including national
            rankings in 1996 (7th of 10) and 1997 (3rd of 10). In 2000, I
            received my third Director award and had the opportunity to direct
            bass tournaments across five regions from 1998 to 2007.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3.5">
            I am a life member of BASS with the rare 30-year patch, a member of
            the Association of B.A.S.S Professionals, and an active conservation
            volunteer for Lake Isabella, Castaic, Pyramid, Casitas, and Cachuma.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-2xl bg-cyan-50 p-5 sm:p-6">
          <h2
            class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-2xl"
          >
            As a Fisherman
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3.5">
            Highlights include 1st place at Yuma in December 2000 and 1st place
            at Pyramid Lake in May 2000, along with big fish awards in both MBAA
            tournaments.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3.5">
            I also earned one 2nd place finish, three 3rd place finishes, one
            5th place finish, three 8th place finishes, and multiple top 10 and
            top 20 placements. In 1997, I ranked 5th nationally among Navy
            fishermen in MBAA programs.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <p>
        Today, after retiring from Northrop Grumman Corporation, I remain the
        humble owner of True Image Enterprise. I bring what I have learned from
        top pro anglers and mentors into developing high-quality soft plastic
        fishing baits for deep-water structure.
      </p>

      <div
        class="h-px w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-cyan-300/70 to-transparent"
      >
      </div>
      <p class="tracking-[0.01em] italic">Thank you and "keep a tight line."</p>
      <p class="font-semibold tracking-wide">Sincerely,</p>
      <p
        class="text-2xl leading-none font-black tracking-[0.08em] text-slate-900"
      >
        Ray Caldwell
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
